  "description": "Our Sparrow inventory has been purchased by VeloMine and is now available here: SPARROW\nSPARROW - Singlespeed Street Style\nComplexity can be beautiful or it can detract from your experience – your commute is full of distractions, the best tool for the day may be the simplest one. The Sparrow was designed to keep things simple. This speedy, understated machine is a minimalist A to B bike: fast as a bird and and light as a feather, best used for flying down city streets or cruising bike lanes on a Sunday.\nProduct Highlights\n\nLightest single speed in its class: Just 22 pounds!\nPremium aluminum frame, fork and fork steerer\nAftermarket SDG Duster saddle\nKMC Anti-Rust Chain\n\nColor-matched aero rims with cnc-machined brake tracks\nAuthentic WTB Thick Slick tires\nShips 95% Assembled, 5 mins and you’re on the road\n\nFitting the Sparrow\n\nSmall frames will best fit riders 4’11” to 5’4”\nMedium frames will best fit riders 5'3 to 5'9\nLarge frames will best fit riders 5'8 to 6'1\nX-Large frames will best fit riders 6'0 and up\n\nGeometry\n\nLifetime Warranty\n\nNo Questions Asked Returns",
